- second run with 2s limit: tps=155.3 p50=1804.52ms p95=2499.26ms, skipped=286
- single-query EXPLAIN: PostGIS && remained Filter under FORCE RLS; 10,000 tenant rows read, 9,039 removed; execution 84.135ms

